description:
Find the MIME (media) type for a file extension or file name, or the extensions for a MIME type. Returns the type, whether it is IANA-registered, aliases, notes and the Content-Type header to send.

Returns: JSON { query, matchedBy: 'extension'|'mime'|'text', count, results[] } with { mime, extensions[], name, category, registered, aliases[], spec, note, contentType }.
Example input: {"query":"woff2"}
